#lang EN
# MyPuppyD — DTC code descriptions, English (UTF-8, no BOM). Sits next to english.lang.
# One line per code: CODE=description. Sections narrow the meaning:
#   (before the first section, or [*])  generic SAE/ISO codes — same meaning for every make
#   [BRAND]                             manufacturer codes (P1xxx, P30xx–P33xx, U1xxx–U2xxx) for that brand
#   [FIAT|ALFA|LANCIA]                  one section under several brands (shared codes)
#   [BRAND\Bosch EDC17C50]              one specific ECU (dispatcher key "BRAND\ECU")
#   [*\Bosch EDC16C39 EURO4]            an ECU family regardless of brand
# Lookup order for a code in "BRAND\ECU": BRAND\ECU → *\ECU → BRAND → *, then the same in EN.
# A later duplicate wins — append corrections at the end without hunting for the original.
# Brand sections are a starting set to be verified; gaps are reported by the app (bot #4).

