# ── Bosch EDC15C4 = BMW DDE4/DDE4.1 (M57) and Rover/Land Rover (M47R) ──
# Codes are raw hex values from the ECU fault path table (solution_dtc_35.h), NOT SAE
# codes — meanings differ from the generic ones. Source: TAG Engineering / JNK Motorsport,
# "BMW Fault Codes", section "DDE 4 and DDE 4.1" (tag-parts.com/tips-info/13115.html).
# Injectors: consecutive codes = consecutive cylinders in FIRING ORDER (M57: 1-5-3-6-2-4).
# No description in sources (2026-10-17): P09F6 P1480 P1490 P1495 P1621 P1630 P18F0
# P19E6 P19FA P1A0E P1A18 P1A22 P1E10 P1E15 P1E20 P3010 P3500 P3525.
